# Dashboard: the frontend is compiled inside the Dockerfile (dashboard-builder
# stage), so its sources have to reach the build context. Exclude only what the
# build must not reuse: a stale local build/ (the stage's own output is
# authoritative), node_modules, and the offline-extracted schema.
